--- !u!114 &7753955110575288516
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 482090458071026776}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3125c85e9da23194b857ccc15a3e00fb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  startingNode:
    npcSentence: "Ah, a new face entering our chambers? \u2014Hi, I am a game developer
      at CGS."
    playerOptions:
    - optionText: What games do you work on?
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: "Pixel art, 3D, XR \u2013 all sorts"
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Crazy, how many have you made?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Many for game jams and hackathons, a few polished and some
              half made which got forgotten in repositories.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a29bae2526caa084c8a79e295242e103, type: 3}
        - optionText: XR? That sounds cool!
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Perks of having our own lab, not just testing but can play
              VR games all night long.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 74adbe416c0a0e94094af88f24398851, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 99fa9149c21e17f4c91660ea223ad001, type: 3}
    - optionText: Is it fun?
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: Think about it this way - you are designing a world where things
          happen according to rules you dictate. Sounds cool eh?
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Do you think I can be good at it?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Of course, you are the chosen one.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 34de1534a797cb44ca9d7bda2e1b0868, type: 3}
        - optionText: Do you all help us with stuff?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Yes but we also push you to explore things on your own
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d98bf4ce6901e074bac36e70694f5e5e, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52f269048d3e6954cb9cc35dce51fe95, type: 3}
    - optionText: That sounds tough
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: Nah, only thing tough is to finish those unfinished projects
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Doesn't that prove me correct?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: It's more due to the fact we get distracted in unplanned
              VR game nights.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e4aff674009957d4eaa0c41a41599170, type: 3}
        - optionText: Unfinished? Why?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: I started off slow but then went on to achieve levels my
              GPU couldn't support.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8768f2036d6da014e89a42b29a81f1a2, type: 3}
        - optionText: Can I try those?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Please do!! It's always difficult to get people to playtest.
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 81536d2e32f768749bddbcea15ef989f, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7e949f045f37098478d1ef4f9ed5ab98, type: 3}
    - optionText: Do you think I can do it?
      nextNode:
        npcSentence: "Well why not? It\u2019s just about bringing your crazy ideas
          to life."
        playerOptions:
        - optionText: Can I make GTA V?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: Love the energy but alone is a herculean task
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 08a904d8dcc8b2840b73972bcda27ab9, type: 3}
        - optionText: What is an ideal starting point?
          nextNode:
            npcSentence: "One mechanic, one level, perfect it \u2013 a great start
              to new beginnings"
            playerOptions: []
            voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b797cd7cb78dfc47bfc2997da974640, type: 3}
        voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 35c84c4c372788e4e8c87023adcbf9ce, type: 3}
    voiceLine: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 424d7e55f8c07f2428d08b1e8b2556bb, type: 3}
